The privacy policy of the Ephyra app (formerly Findroid CE) is published at
https://midasvo.nl/ephyra/privacy.html. Its source is site/privacy.html in this repository.

In short: Ephyra does not collect or access any personal information, and its developer receives
nothing. The app talks to the Jellyfin servers you add yourself. There is one optional exception:
external ratings are off by default, and while you have them on, with your own MDBList key,
opening a movie or show page sends that item's IMDb, TMDB or TVDB ID and your key to mdblist.com.
Nothing else is made available to third parties.

Inquiries can be submitted via https://github.com/midasvo/ephyra/issues.
